  m_text: 'Rules :


    Yellow Desks are the ones you need to copy.

    Get close
    and press F to start copying.

    Green Desk is your desk.

    You''ll need
    to get back to it after copying everyone needed.

    Use ZQSD/WASD to move,
    shift to run (hold), space to jump and C to crouch (hold)

    Use A/Q and E
    to switch between the cameras'
